Surely it wasn't about their ship.

247
00:20:44,071 --> 00:20:47,031
No, they must have been aiming to steal something.

248
00:20:47,031 --> 00:20:52,551
But seeing as they left empty-handed, I have a good idea what they were looking for.

249
00:20:53,271 --> 00:20:58,031
The question is, if they were working with the government, or if they want it for themselves.

250
00:20:59,091 --> 00:21:00,011
Strawhat Luffy.

251
00:21:01,471 --> 00:21:03,811
This just in! Breaking news!

252
00:21:04,631 --> 00:21:08,391
Iceberg has already identified the culprits from the break-in last night!

253
00:21:08,491 --> 00:21:09,991
What? Is that true?

254
00:21:10,331 --> 00:21:13,311
Spread the word through the city and we'll capture them ourselves!

255
00:21:13,311 --> 00:21:16,191
We can't let those criminals leave Water 7!

256
00:21:16,491 --> 00:21:17,431
Who did it?

257
00:21:17,431 --> 00:21:23,071
Show no mercy to the monsters who attacked our mayor!

258
00:21:26,271 --> 00:21:29,731
Capture the Strawhat Pirates no matter what it takes!

259
00:21:29,731 --> 00:21:40,291
Take it out!

260
00:21:40,831 --> 00:21:41,211
Music

261
00:21:41,211 --> 00:22:11,191
See you next time.

262
00:23:06,251 --> 00:23:10,251
On the next, One Piece, the Straw Hat Pirates are the culprits,

263
00:23:10,251 --> 00:23:12,251
the protectors of the City of Water!

264
00:23:12,251 --> 00:23:14,251
I'm gonna be king of the pirates!

